#: badend2:badend2_E81EC2ED_7A6F_4E49_B697_9FCC7EC85082
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c57c729738bbaf39257ceefea72529458d08eb6d29fba0399c3578a27d0baacc
#. default-sha256: cbbba98877c738775227fcc9aa7a0e92d51767c553c3216323eb2226b916cb9d
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_E81EC2ED_7A6F_4E49_B697_9FCC7EC85082"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫You⟪k:21⟫The Departed⟪k:22⟫ could not accept the Maid’s offer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫――받아들여선 안 된다."

#: badend2:badend2_33A5723D_E91F_4B4B_B3E7_29178B387314
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05a275334c0ecfd5f2a9d972d1b1254c0aa099ccea7b2672306c015e791bec17
#. default-sha256: 216700cfa3577d27318a7d95cc52dd7f7480406794402e7483bead16f37009f4
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_33A5723D_E91F_4B4B_B3E7_29178B387314"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If what she said was true, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫he⟪k:3⟫ could not give up on ⟪k:4⟫Your⟪k:5⟫his⟪k:6⟫ "
"search."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 말이 사실이라면 ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「당신」은⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫「죽은 자」는⟪k:5⟫ 포기해선 안 된다."

#: badend2:badend2_80517542_50EF_4845_B1BE_3B78A8E57242
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09e0900fdecfeed563fa4d777798563067e863e7f19ec095bae21555b33800a8
#. default-sha256: 5df6bf71e6c3c523fe785260493534a398d6aa4bf652c1c1cf4edd64caa316d5
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_80517542_50EF_4845_B1BE_3B78A8E57242"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ had spent years and years waiting to reunite with someone.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫Your⟪k:7⟫His⟪k:8⟫ previous attempts may have been rife with mistakes,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「당신」은⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「죽은 자」는⟪k:4⟫ 누군가를 다시 만나고자 ⟪k:5⟫오랜 세월을 반복했"
"다. ⟪k:6⟫그게 비록 ⟪k:7⟫비극의 연속일지라도……"

#: badend2:badend2_155BDA4C_4B1C_4162_82A2_B7C905A6F03B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ddda9d0a1e02b34e16f1be1ef832f4a8649bb6a3e76541ac798868c7b80ee1e8
#. default-sha256: 0528c1b42eb40eed414850d5a49bb7ab1949639d9ed9084847234f139e5bbe9b
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_155BDA4C_4B1C_4162_82A2_B7C905A6F03B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫he⟪k:3⟫ could not stop trying."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫반드시 ⟪k:1⟫찾아내야만 한다."

#: badend2:badend2_FC3E3AEE_F43B_4252_95DB_D3633CE93C81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6745efff8af1179b93a46f45b2c227e19db0ab91d54dc147fad79a727d9091be
#. default-sha256: 0bdffdda0db3ae62298da8914a0cca2308dde82b8230fac5706dc94836e4f4ed
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_FC3E3AEE_F43B_4252_95DB_D3633CE93C81"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Come, Master. ⟪k:3⟫Spend eternity with me in the mansion.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫We will have "
"the most wonderful time together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫자…… 주인님. ⟪k:3⟫저와 함께 ⟪k:4⟫저택에서 지내시지요. ⟪k:5⟫즐거운 나날이 기다릴 거"
"랍니다……."

#: badend2:badend2_60B37471_CF71_4582_AC06_A3A0CD0EBC0D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5b4b0cb4070be45aadd8234aaa370e66825af0e74ac40f759bd0d4584a71550c
#. default-sha256: 79c7acc89baac6d09c83b8ed17872a77066e863efe6fb307052259018f68ae69
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_60B37471_CF71_4582_AC06_A3A0CD0EBC0D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫These were all terrifying now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫시녀의 달콤한 목소리. ⟪k:1⟫싸늘한 손끝. ⟪k:2⟫얼음 같은 미소. ⟪k:3⟫그 모든 게 ⟪k:4⟫지금은 무시"
"무시하게 보였다."

#: badend2:badend2_E920478E_380D_40E0_9D6F_C1D5F3F22207
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad290e18368566c4393b8e2b2d5c237496741e4f0de3ebb8cbe1416f6d6e7e7a
#. default-sha256: 0b82de1ce3ba8e131387e404a0b688f150e2aeb168f720216dd9f61cc091ff63
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_E920478E_380D_40E0_9D6F_C1D5F3F22207"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫The Departed⟪k:3⟫ had to escape."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……도망쳐야 한다."

#: badend2:badend2_BEEAD61C_6656_4F1B_916B_4AB6BF25FD13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd9a74dd2b93730dcdf555066023ba0dfc62f6101790df1042a41d33d07e8ba8
#. default-sha256: 647868f186f26af05412dde194128fc015abed286b73d532ab8c6d435a33fcc3
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_BEEAD61C_6656_4F1B_916B_4AB6BF25FD13"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Had to break out of this darkness, make it outside."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이 어둠 속에서 ⟪k:1⟫바깥 세계로……."

#: badend2:badend2_DCAE5A81_0F95_44CE_96DD_DCE8DF36E8FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a12362dbc3436558df222e6c7361aa58742cde0a3d5211aa4cdb60feb162771e
#. default-sha256: 345bdf49483f541ad6999e7cbf4cde4664e320604bb2c5ef2eb0fcc5197d4fa4
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_DCAE5A81_0F95_44CE_96DD_DCE8DF36E8FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Master? ⟪k:3⟫What is the—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫주인님……? ⟪k:3⟫왜 그러시는――"

#: badend2:badend2_7D4AC5A9_92B5_4EB0_8126_EE36DAD7F283
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb19da36167e3dcca6d3e10d1afd2e26152d9326b102250f64d543427321f491
#. default-sha256: e34dcdf8339afc65034b5dd464e919225d8c2ff3ea2ce6b7d84a135ff496c330
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_7D4AC5A9_92B5_4EB0_8126_EE36DAD7F283"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You⟪k:4⟫He⟪k:5⟫ brushed the Maid’s hand aside.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫As her eyes widened, "
"aghast, ⟪k:8⟫You⟪k:9⟫he⟪k:10⟫ fled from the observation tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「당신」은⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫「죽은 자」는⟪k:6⟫ 시녀의 손을 뿌리쳤다. ⟪k:7⟫경악한 표정"
"을 지은 시녀를 두고 ⟪k:8⟫감시탑을 떠났다."

#: badend2:badend2_A3A19873_9FF8_4F6D_ABA1_EB8E9A7EEE89
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73c30e654f84285b52624efc97a020505eecfd60fd9a551fd74d9299b174d78c
#. default-sha256: 4f6f76e0839c52b155a32814115a74d1bb9bfd8f486f3b72c4a90001910f45e9
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_A3A19873_9FF8_4F6D_ABA1_EB8E9A7EEE89"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Down and down the spiral staircase ⟪k:3⟫You⟪k:4⟫he⟪k:5⟫ went, though not a whisper "
"of a footstep could be heard in the stone tower. ⟪k:6⟫The stairs seemed to go on forever."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫긴 나선 계단을 ⟪k:3⟫내려갔다. ⟪k:4⟫발소리는 들리지 않았다. ⟪k:5⟫영원하게 느껴지는 "
"계단을 ⟪k:6⟫하염없이 내려갔다."

#: badend2:badend2_1971F44F_273D_4E0B_A285_3EB8D4B69B09
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06cad6a57e669327ee840756176c01fcb7fb899dbbdf93951a7c0dde6384c592
#. default-sha256: d5198ad2d7508ace6b7916f554b77908d8738ae238903e9942986d3171f5788a
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_1971F44F_273D_4E0B_A285_3EB8D4B69B09"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Down and down and down and down..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내려갔다, ⟪k:1⟫내려갔다, ⟪k:2⟫내려갔다, ⟪k:3⟫내려갔다……."

#: badend2:badend2_71CD261B_E4FB_441E_A0DB_71E9AB756C0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1ed89ef207587fc501f956513fafa4f1724e87547a0074cb5ee85c4fb7d01b4
#. default-sha256: af01602d9c71a766336f11652edc78b5d383ebed62e9beb7cfe8a32506cc90bd
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_71CD261B_E4FB_441E_A0DB_71E9AB756C0C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At long last, ⟪k:3⟫You⟪k:4⟫the Departed⟪k:5⟫ arrived at the bottom, dashing from "
"the next room without a passing glance at the angel in the stained-glass window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫이윽고 스테인드 글라스가 있는 방에 도착했다. ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫「당신」은⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫「죽은 "
"자」는⟪k:7⟫ 천사의 그림을 거들떠보지도 않고 ⟪k:8⟫달렸다."

#: badend2:badend2_9452EA81_98F8_424E_9759_125A43BC5142
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d592326ed604406a58f05e66a6715cfbba1ec171b00334832bfbf22e3c9d733
#. default-sha256: 2e3402e4593c7b05f17a8ff5faaa50ee6249787beee0f22bc8f515f2f3675e65
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_9452EA81_98F8_424E_9759_125A43BC5142"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫The Maid had shown ⟪k:9⟫You⟪k:10⟫him⟪k:11⟫ around "
"the mansion, so ⟪k:12⟫You⟪k:13⟫he⟪k:14⟫ knew its layout."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫기억한다. ⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫「당신」은⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫「죽은 "
"자」는⟪k:13⟫ 시녀에게 손을 이끌려 다녔다. ⟪k:14⟫그래서 ⟪k:15⟫이 저택의 구조를―― 알고 있다."

#: badend2:badend2_3B6AC469_BC72_4416_B5FE_CBF87F7C49E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a1aef105280734eaf9be3c63ed1a65098fbf782df1038f9535bfa9632543c076
#. default-sha256: 395c85c4189675f730e6ab25b64e5816d80f0d90f2a430f597174a3754642b62
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_3B6AC469_BC72_4416_B5FE_CBF87F7C49E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Or perhaps..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫혹은……"

#: badend2:badend2_05B7D727_4E82_4E03_8069_3EAE9DB44E5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9deb8b31ac9140ed6c76dc944e1207a6187cadc318bc2faf193e3cd2e5da35da
#. default-sha256: 127575f37730e054fa30d1ffcb3ccf63fe87a7f91a6ebedff5055841aa1963fc
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_05B7D727_4E82_4E03_8069_3EAE9DB44E5F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You were⟪k:2⟫he was⟪k:3⟫ familiar with it even before arriving here."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 전부터 ⟪k:1⟫알던 것일 수도 있겠다만."

#: badend2:badend2_4F168C13_B50C_4B17_9524_6828D432A5A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40becfda9e9c30dd1fecf1753ced86439800619720803b03bae86a491528e572
#. default-sha256: e6600a4989dc0a1721d47648601a9e37cb67698d99d92ba72aabc3bc0272f71e
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_4F168C13_B50C_4B17_9524_6828D432A5A5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A large door came into view. ⟪k:1⟫The exit was up ahead."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫출구 앞까지 왔다. ⟪k:1⟫현관 대문이 ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「당신」⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫「죽은 자」⟪k:6⟫ 앞에 있었다."

#: badend2:badend2_2234A750_B2AD_4B18_BBF0_F8962C89636C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5513c19e71b1272884d55b50ee71d4b6543099f049a71d41b285af1eebc58b39
#. default-sha256: a58f9a35f29a8746c23b52586cd41665fd92c4c5d09860e711e839cde5873c83
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_2234A750_B2AD_4B18_BBF0_F8962C89636C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫―――주인님."

#: badend2:badend2_3A6FE51F_0E31_4710_817A_7E3EDCC8F603
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 789b6dad566ef3535f1a43d2757981a6f894aff348f144096fe13570a810bf5b
#. default-sha256: ee3389602db6328a7d67f90a0e411b54c0ea2a179da3dfd40a628ee160bb12e1
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_3A6FE51F_0E31_4710_817A_7E3EDCC8F603"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But the next moment, her voice seized ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ from behind.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"You⟪k:7⟫The Departed⟪k:8⟫ turned back, and there stood the Maid,⟪k:9⟫wearing the same smile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 그 순간, ⟪k:1⟫여자 목소리가 ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「당신」⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫「죽은 자」⟪k:6⟫의 등을 붙들었"
"다. ⟪k:7⟫뒤를 돌아보니, ⟪k:8⟫그곳에는 여전히 미소를 짓는 시녀가 있었다."

#: badend2:badend2_0D38A2CE_82CE_43BC_B3C8_0FC474C863BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c237022d071ff475f1b2e20283005216d20ca39fb89818fedf2910157a70d54
#. default-sha256: daa09de9fe391bbccd56e634dc78873d5b42363abe2ff03958222132ac45d471
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_0D38A2CE_82CE_43BC_B3C8_0FC474C863BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Where do you think you are going, Master?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I told you, you mustn’t let go "
"of my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫주인님…… 어디로 가시려는 건지요?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그러시면 안 되어요, ⟪k:5⟫제 손을 놓으시다"
"니……."

#: badend2:badend2_38309D2C_2E9B_4AC0_A323_3B24BC06066F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f28e7fa922699ef7c5cef0ea8d4de3a74e96871f7b54eecea70b0899cb2890ca
#. default-sha256: 2b4c4c315b6c7f4d7c82421227aca058b058b0dcd85c804c87638f6f63bcef50
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_38309D2C_2E9B_4AC0_A323_3B24BC06066F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This mansion is quite large.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You could get lost if you go walking around "
"unaccompanied."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫이 저택은 몹시 넓으니, ⟪k:3⟫무턱대고 돌아다니면 ⟪k:4⟫길을 잃으실 거랍니다."

#: badend2:badend2_1086B956_AF4E_4BBC_A128_A726A1941CE4
